# pins_enet.qsf -- DE2-115 pin assignments: both Marvell 88E1111 Ethernet PHYs (GMII/MII + MDIO + reset)
#
# GENERATED by hw/de2-115/common/make_pins.py. Every pin below appears
# in BOTH the Terasic DE2-115 user manual and a DE2-115 project that
# Quartus has fitted and that runs Ethernet on this board, with the same
# value. Signals the two sources did not agree on are not here at all.
#
# Include from a project .qsf with:
#     set_global_assignment -name SOURCE_TCL_SCRIPT_FILE pins_enet.qsf
# ...or paste the contents in. Verify against YOUR board revision
# before programming: Terasic has shipped more than one DE2-115 rev.

